	(text "RF chain: SMA J1 (active L1/L5 antenna) -> bias tee -> L1/L5 split -> PX100 (SkyTraq PX100 DS p13)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 17.78 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.905 1.905)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "71180277-bc42-5869-a93c-a437fcc7de36")
	)
	(text "Input: J1 edge SMA (the carrier's), D6 ESD (TPD1E0B04, +/-3.6 V: fine at 3.3 V),\nbias tee L1 47 nH + C20 1 uF (SkyTraq's L2/C4), C26 33 pF DC block.\nAntenna power: R2 fitted = +3V3 straight, as in the reference. R3 instead\nof R2 = the PX100's ANT_BIAS output (pin 9, 45 mA short-circuit limit).\nThe ESP32 reads ANT_BIAS and VANT. DC-block J1 when an SDR feeds it."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 104.14 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "6f4dfb90-26f6-55cb-92e0-dca58a6e1bd9")
	)
	(text "SH1 + SH2: Laird BMI-S-202-F frame and BMI-S-202-C snap-on cover (16.5 x 16.5 mm),\nthe carrier's V1 parts. Cover U1, Y1 and the split; J1, the bias tee and the 1 k links\nto the ESP32 sit outside."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 312.42 132.08 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "056086aa-7394-5646-99e3-877bc827fb3b")
	)
)
